sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Tournament Service
    participant MM as Matchmaking Service
    participant OR as Battle Orchestrator
    participant W as Engine Workers
    participant RT as Rating Service
    participant RP as Replay Service
    participant BR as Event Broker

    T->>MM: Publish open slots
    MM->>MM: Pair players (strategy)
    MM->>BR: match.created
    BR->>OR: Consume(match.created)
    OR->>OR: Reserve match
    OR->>W: RunMatch(matchId) (gRPC)
    W-->>OR: MatchFinished(result, artifacts)
    OR->>BR: match.finished
    OR->>RP: Upload replay
    RP->>BR: battle.replay.available
    BR->>RT: Consume(match.finished)
    RT->>RT: Recalculate ratings
    RT->>BR: rating.updated


